  "details": "Currently, when we use the \"Warn User\" button in VRChat, a generic message is sent stating \"You have been warned for your behavior.\"\n\nHowever, I believe it would greatly enhance the user experience if we were able to provide a specific reason for the warning. By including a customized explanation, such as \"A moderator has sent you a warning: Please refrain from micspamming,\" the user would immediately understand what they have done wrong, allowing for clearer communication.",
